  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/03/P1530686.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(21 fotos) Man&aacute; Bar, en la calle 8 de Marzo de Onda, ha acogido la noche de este viernes un mercadillo con ropa falmenca y complementos para que toda aquellas personas que lo quisieran se pudieran equipar para la</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/03/FiraDabril.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 698px;\" /></p>\n<p>Feria de Abril, que se celebrar&aacute; en el Recinto Multiusos el viernes 31 de marzo y el s&aacute;bado 1 de abril.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetflamencmanabar/p1530675.jpg\" alt=\"p1530675\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetflamencmanabar/p1530676.jpg\" alt=\"p1530676\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetflamencmanabar/p1530677.jpg\" alt=\"p1530677\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetflamencmanabar/p1530679.jpg\" alt=\"p1530679\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetflamencmanabar/p1530680.jpg\" alt=\"p1530680\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetflamencmanabar/p1530681.jpg\" alt=\"p1530681\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetflamencmanabar/p1530682.jpg\" alt=\"p1530682\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetflamencmanabar/p1530683.jpg\" alt=\"p1530683\" style=\"max-width:100%;heigh